Z||000007||BAM-BAM||10-31-2000||07:43 PM||||   Loki, I believe you might be mistaken. Tom's light kit doesn't have covers (YET) It's something he is still working on. I also believe that those are standard 55W Halogen lights not fog lights. IRM or RSM, I can't remember which, also made a similar kit with lexon covers. There is a question about light refraction with the covers. There is also another kit that uses the oval fog lights that some have raised questions of legality about. Either way, I like Tom's kit and will be buying one in the near future. Monk, what is the issue with the covers? just courious.<P> Late, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT<BR>Eibach Springs/KYB shocks and struts<BR>Mr.Mikes 500 series seats, Carpet and headliner! MOMO Commando Steering Wheel, White Face Race Style Guages And Soon To Be More!!! YEAH BABY-YEAH||||reg||1
